ott.de\">mail@retrokompott.de</a><br />\n<strong>Ihr findet uns auch bei </strong><strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/retrokompott\">Twitter</a>, </strong><strong>auf </strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/retrokompott/?fref=ts\">Facebook</a>, </strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><strong>oder auf unser </strong><strong><a href=\"http://www.retrokompott.de\">Homepage</a></strong><strong>.</strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">Unterstuetzen kann man den Podcast bei <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/retrokompott?ty=h\">PATREON</a><br />\n</span></div>\n<hr />\n<p>Die Links aus dem Podcast:</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><a href=\"http://www.hoerspitzen.de/2015/09/17/hsp004-wordpress/\">WordPress Infos</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.c64-wiki.de/index.php/SFD-1001\">Das &#8222;grosse&#8220; Diskettenlaufwrk fuer den C64</a></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"http://fs-uae.net\">AMIGA Emulator fuer den MAC</a></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6n5c0nUhJSg\">RETRO in der Neuzeit</a></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"http://www.adventuregamesite.de/la-spezi-rezepte.php\">Das GROG Rezept</a></div>\n<div class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid26\" class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"http://www.c64-wiki.de/index.php/1st_CD-Edition_%28Sammlung%29\"><span class=\"b\"><b>Rainbow Arts 1st CD-Edition<br />\n</b></span></a></div>\n<div id=\"magi